OL,3,AItalian PM files to trademark her voice
OL,4,Aagainst AI threats
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeloni is not alone in filing to
OL,7,Fprotect her identity from unauthorised
OL,8,Fuse by AI platforms. In January, US
OL,9,Factor Matthew McConaughey led the way
OL,10,Fby trademarking his image and voice.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
