OL,3,AASOS app users receive push
OL,4,Anotifications apparently sent by
OL,5,Ahackers
OL,6,
OL,7,FAsos users across the UK have been sent
OL,8,Fpop-up messages from its app that
OL,9,Fappear to have been sent by hackers
OL,10,Ftrying to extort the company.
OL,12,FDozens of people have told the BBC
OL,13,Fabout receiving a strange message from
OL,14,Fthe clothing and beauty store's app,
OL,15,Fappearing on their phone screens.
OL,17,F"Dear ASOS DPO and IT, we have fully
OL,18,Fcompromised the Snowflake instance.
OL,19,FEngage with us, or we will leak it,"
OL,20,Fthe message reads.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
