OL,3,AFrom films to streaming prices - how
OL,4,Athe Warner Bros deal could affect you
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has been months in the making but
OL,7,FParamount Skydance has finally
OL,8,Fcompleted its $110bn (#82.8bn) merger
OL,9,Fwith Warner Bros Discovery.
OL,11,FThe deal welds two legacy Hollywood
OL,12,Fpowerhouses, uniting franchises like
OL,13,FHarry Potter and Game of Thrones, into
OL,14,Fan entertainment behemoth named
OL,15,FSkydance.
OL,17,FYet behind this milestone lies strict
OL,18,Frules about what the combined business
OL,19,Fcan and cannot do - from how many films
OL,20,Fit must produce a year to the editorial
OL,21,Findependence of its newsroom.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
